  email =        "\email{imamura}{phys02.phys.kobe-u.ac.jp}",
  abstract =    "We propose a characteristic representation of
                 one-dimensional and 2-state, 3-neighbor cellular
                 automaton rules, which describes an effective form of
                 each rule after many time steps. Simulated results of
                 the representation show that complex structures of
                 Class IV rules come from their aspects of Class II and
                 III. Class IV-like patterns can be generated by
                 characteristic functions of a linear combenation of
                 Class II and III rule functions.",
